    given-names: "Eraldo Pereira"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7413-0161"
    affiliation: "Institute of Geoscience and Exact Sciences, São Paulo State University (UNESP)"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-30
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23815956
repository-code: "https://github.com/epmarinho/astroclassifier-repro"
url: "https://github.com/epmarinho/astroclassifier-repro"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility archive for an object-independent evaluation of small-data
  astronomical image classifiers. It contains the implementation, frozen
  experimental protocols, provenance records, predictions, aggregate results,
  manuscript, and reproducible figures for comparisons of a custom
  CNN--Transformer, ResNet-50, and ViT-B/16.
keywords:
  - astronomical image classification
  - small datasets
  - object-independent evaluation
  - shortcut learning
  - convolutional neural networks
  - vision transformers
